Zainabe bawafa alvida alvida,<br>
Binte mushkil kusha alvida alvida.<br>
<br>
Ap bhi hogayi'n belche se shaheed,<br>
Fidyaye kibriya alvida alvida.<br>
<br>
Abede natawa'n kar rahe hain fugha'n,<br>
Aye phupi bawafa alvida alvida.<br>
<br>
Kunba rota hai sab dekhiye uthke ab,<br>
Sar hai sabka khula alvida alvida.<br>
<br>
Hoke hum se qafa sue darulbaqa,<br>
Kooch tumne kiya alvida alvida.<br>
<br>
Hashr me aye phupi shakl dikhlaogi,<br>
Hoti ho ab juda alvida alvida.<br>
<br>
Lash Zainab ki 'Baqer' uthate hai ab,<br>
Hai haram me sada alvida alvida...